  "instructions": [
    "bring a large pot of salted water to a boil and cook the spaghetti until slightly under al dente.",
    "in a sous-vide machine set to 82c, combine the chicken broth, heavy cream, sour cream, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "in a hot pan, heat the olive oil over medium heat and saut\u00166 the garlic until fragrant.",
    "add the cooked spaghetti to the pan with the garlic and toss to combine.",
    "add the paprika to the pan and toss to combine.",
    "place the comal vessel over the pan and carefully pour in the sous-vide mixture.",
    "stir to combine and cook for an additional 2-3 minutes.",
    "garnish with fresh parsley and edible flowers, if using.",
    "serve immediately."
  ],
